# Document

"document.tip.winCond.journalist.title" : "Public Opinion Win"
"document.tip.winCond.journalist" : "When reaches enough news buzz, it will steer public opinion to hype own self up as a win."

"role.journalist.doc" : "A neutral who takes photo of the selected player, and discloses it at the meeting.<br>Guess the hidden player of the picture to find who he is !"
"role.journalist.winCond" : "Reach enough buzz and photo count, the Journalist will win."
"role.journalist.ability.title" : "Inherent Ability [Hot News]"
"role.journalist.ability.main" : "Take photos from the cam of the selected player to disclose at the meeting, and the selected player will be hidden in the photo.<br>All players can click on the photo to guess who the hidden player in the picture is. <br>A incorrect guess adds 1 point of buzz, while making no guess adds 0.5 points of buzz."
"role.journalist.tips" : "・The role is created by <b>DHMO</b>."

